

### 1. Get all events
GET http://localhost:3000/api/events

### 2. Get upcoming events
GET http://localhost:3000/api/events/upcoming

### 3. Get event with ID 1
GET http://localhost:3000/api/events/1

### 4. Get sessions belonging to event 1
GET http://localhost:3000/api/events/1/sessions

### 5. Get session 2 belonging to event 1
GET http://localhost:3000/api/events/1/sessions/2

### 6. Create a new event
POST http://localhost:3000/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Programming Workshop",
  "description": "A practical programming workshop for students.",
  "location": "Computer Lab 2",
  "eventDate": "2026-12-15",
  "category": "Technology 1",
  "isPublished": true
}